00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,400
谁告诉你盖噗的事的
Who told you about the Gap?

173
00:08:48,740 --> 00:08:51,500
你自己啊 你有一次喝醉酒 在折件毛衣
You, that time you were drunk, folding a sweater,

174
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:53,260
你说 让你推荐一下招牌休闲短裤来
and you tried to help me "spring into summer"

175
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:54,500
"甩开春天 迎接夏天"
with cargo shorts.

176
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:59,420
行 我是跳入盖噗[火坑]过 当时需要钱
Fine! I fell into the Gap. I needed the money.

177
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:02,620
或许塞巴斯安也是需要钱啊
Maybe Sebastian needs the money, too.

178
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:03,660
谁啊
Who?

179
00:09:06,780 --> 00:09:09,260
如果你敢告诉别人我在盖噗的事
And if you ever tell anyone about the Gap,

180
00:09:09,460 --> 00:09:11,680
你的原来项上人头之处
you will have a gap between your neck

181
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:13,020
也会变成大坑[盖噗]
and where your head used to be.

182
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,380
"你特么在逗我吗"
"Oh, no you didn't."

183
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:22,500
我本来不确定会不会打扰你们睡觉
Hey, I wasn't sure if it was too late to come by

184
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:26,520
但是我的碟仙板指示"去吧 她们还没睡"
but the Ouija board said, "Go ahead, the girls are up!"

185
00:09:28,900 --> 00:09:30,120
你信这个啊
You use that?

186
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:33,000
我唯一信的仙 是廉价酒中仙
The only spirit I listen to is 2-buck-chuck,

187
00:09:33,060 --> 00:09:35,120
而这色老头总是叫我脱掉上衣
and he mostly tells me to take my top off.

188
00:09:37,060 --> 00:09:39,320
碟仙帮助我做了很多重大决定
Yeah, Ouija helps me make all my big decisions.

189
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,620
比如来美国
Like coming to America,

190
00:09:42,260 --> 00:09:43,900
收养一个中国孤儿
adopting a Chinese orphan,

191
00:09:44,420 --> 00:09:47,040
以及把那中国孤儿丢到消防局
and leaving a Chinese orphan at the fire station.

192
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:51,180
这东西超诡异
Those boards are creepy.

193
00:09:51,260 --> 00:09:52,760
你永远不知道请到的是仙是鬼
you never know what you're inviting in.

194
00:09:52,820 --> 00:09:54,420
万一请到深渊巨口怎么办
I mean, what if we open a hellmouth?

195
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,680
拜托 姑娘们 看看你们四周
Aw, come on, girls, look around.

196
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,540
你们已经在地狱之中啦
I mean, you already have.

197
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:04,540
现在安静 来吧
Okay, now shh. Okay...

198
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:06,360
碟仙
Ouija,

199
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:10,080
我是否该跟奥列格复合呢
should I take Oleg back?

200
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:16,640
是
Yes?

201
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,800
你们看 太吓人了
Oh, now, see, that is creepy

202
00:10:19,820 --> 00:10:21,660
我刚才一直想推到"否"呢
because I was shoving it to "No".

203
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:26,500
你想跟他复合吗
Do you want to get back with him?

204
00:10:26,500 --> 00:10:28,480
我很左右为难
Well, I'm torn.

205
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,800
而且我也不知道该怎么做
And also, I don't know what to do.

206
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:38,040
把手放在空中甩 把甘蓝都买起来
Throw your hands in the air like you just don't kale.

207
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:43,660
我很高兴你能够不介意他的工作
Max, I'm proud of you for overlooking his job

208
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:45,180
给人家一次机会
and giving this guy a chance.

209
00:10:47,180 --> 00:10:49,020
他在装那副DJ脸 我看不下去了
He's making a DJ face. I'm out.

210
00:10:50,940 --> 00:10:53,300
天啊 迪伦
Oh, my God, Dylan.

211
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:55,440
我们不能现在走
No, we can't leave now.

212
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,720
我刚看到了
I just saw this girl,

213
00:10:56,740 --> 00:10:58,700
这世上我最不想见到的人
and she is the last person I want to see.

214
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:00,156
你跟她是怎么回事
What is the problem?

215
00:11:00,156 --> 00:11:01,720
是 希拉里·沃德尔
It's Hilary Waldare.

216
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,680
我们以前一起在沃顿读书
We went to Wharton together.

217
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:04,220
她超爱跟我比较
So competitive with me.

218
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:06,000
当我家破产时 她超幸灾乐祸
Loved it when I lost all my money.

219
00:11:06,260 --> 00:11:07,780
她还特别办了一个派对庆祝
She even threw a party to celebrate

220
00:11:07,780 --> 00:11:09,900
而且她还有种到邀请我去
and then had the nerve to invite me.

221
00:11:11,420 --> 00:11:12,580
对了 她那派对瞎到爆
Worst party ever, by the way.

222
00:11:14,460 --> 00:11:17,520
有比位在一家超市里的舞厅还瞎吗
Uh, worse than being at a dance club that has a price club?

223
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:20,920
麦克斯·布莱克来到了麦子之家
Max black in the house of grain.

224
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,500
而且被他看到我了
And now he saw me.

225
00:11:25,740 --> 00:11:27,760
我得在她看到我之前先躲起来
Well, I'm gonna go hide before she sees me.

226
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:30,220
我去汤姆斯布鞋店躲着 那里从没人去
I'll be in Tom's shoes. Nobody's ever over there.

227
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:37,760
给大家"带来"我散养的电子舞曲
I'm bustin' out some free range electronic dance music.

228
00:11:38,100 --> 00:11:38,840
没错
That's right!

229
00:11:39,020 --> 00:11:40,720
用我自带的购物袋"带来"的哦
I'm bringing it in my own bag.

230
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,860
好了 我们没问题吧
Uh, okay, we good?

231
00:11:45,980 --> 00:11:46,700
下周二见
See you next Tuesday.

232
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,720
别这样 留下 干嘛这么急
Come on, stay. What's your hurry?

233
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,900
我看不下这些人边跳边逛了
I can't watch any more people dance-shop.

234
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:54,520
麦克斯 来嘛 来我前面
Max, come on. Get in front of me.

235
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,220
看看你有啥招
See what you can do.

236
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,760
这次你到我后面了 挺新鲜
Oh, you're behind me this time--that's new.

237
00:11:59,580 --> 00:12:00,779
好了 各位
All right, everybody,

238
00:12:00,779 --> 00:12:05,160
苦苣[别动] 我们来了特别来宾DJ哦
Frisee, 'cause we got a special guest DJ in the hizzay

239
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:07,600
辣到有辣椒这么辣哦
who's so hot it's radicchio.

240
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:10,420
来吧
Go on.

241
00:12:11,194 --> 00:12:14,020
鲍伯 我想下注一块钱
Bob, I'd like to bid $1.00.

242
00:12:14,020 --> 00:12:16,180
一块钱 鲍伯 一块钱
$1.00, Bob, $1.00.

243
00:12:16,180 --> 00:12:17,820
请带您的宠物做绝育手术
Have your pets spayed or neutered.

244
00:12:18,740 --> 00:12:20,340
说到绝育后的宠物 阿憨在这里哦
Speaking of neutered pets, here comes Han.

245
00:12:22,580 --> 00:12:24,160
这照样算是DJ喊话哦
Still counts as a DJ shout-out.

246
00:12:26,060 --> 00:12:27,620
为什么要等到周二
Hey, why wait till Tuesday?

247
00:12:28,300 --> 00:12:29,720
何不我直接休息一下 然后我们去后面
Why don't I take a break and we can go in the back.

248
00:12:30,140 --> 00:12:31,400
只需找一个人顶替我就行了
I just need to find someone to cover me.

249
00:12:32,660 --> 00:12:34,500
有人把果仁酱全买完了
Someone bogarted all the nut butter.

250
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:38,160
找"半个人"顶替你行吗
How about half of someone?

251
00:12:49,580 --> 00:12:50,820
需要帮忙吗 小姐
Can I help you, Miss?

252
00:12:51,380 --> 00:12:51,860
麦克斯
Max?

253
00:12:52,260 --> 00:12:53,180
你这是干什么
What are you doing?

254
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,240
口渴难耐 家财散尽
I'm thirsty, broke,

255
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,920
试喝柠檬水的人也不许我再喝了
and they cut me off at the free lemonade.

256
00:12:57,380 --> 00:12:58,240
你又在干什么
What are you doing?

257
00:12:58,700 --> 00:13:01,820
两男的抢先在亲子厕所里开搞了 所以...
Well, two dudes were getting it on in the family restroom, so...

258
00:13:03,060 --> 00:13:04,020
塞巴斯安呢
Where's Sebastian?

259
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:04,780
谁啊
Who?

260
00:13:05,620 --> 00:13:07,160
他啊 架子下面放牛奶那
Oh, milk. Bottom shelf.

261
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,180
你好啊
What's up?

262
00:13:15,820 --> 00:13:18,340
不许在乳制品货架后面开搞
You're not doing it in the dairy case!

263
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:21,200
我才没有呢 因为你在这碍事
Uh, no I'm not, 'cause you won't go away.

264
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:23,980
为什么在哪你都要坏我"好事"啊
Do you have to ruin sex everywhere?

265
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:27,880
麦克斯 就算我以前没有乳糖不耐症
Well, Max, if I wasn't lactose intolerant before,

266
00:13:27,900 --> 00:13:28,860
现在也有了
I am now.

267
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:34,354
天啊 这不是卡洛琳·钱宁吗
Oh, my God, Caroline channing!

268
00:13:34,354 --> 00:13:37,700
你好啊 我是希拉里·沃德尔
Hi! It's Hilary Waldare.

269
00:13:37,700 --> 00:13:40,140
-天啊 你好 -你好
- Oh, my God! Hi! - Hi!

270
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:43,100
自从派对之后 我就没见过你了
I haven't seen you since your party.

271
00:13:43,420 --> 00:13:46,300
听说你是哭着离开的 最近过得好吗
Someone said you left crying. How are you?

272
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:49,820
非常好 我专门来全食超市
I'm great! I mean, I'm shopping at Whole Foods,

273
00:13:49,900 --> 00:13:52,600
买点有机营养奶
buying some organic fuel

274
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,980
我可能就在动感单车课上小酌一两口
that I'll probably take a couple sips of in spin class

275
00:13:54,980 --> 00:13:56,160
然后整瓶扔掉
and then throw away, so...

276
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:59,980
那就好 因为我听说你穷得叮当响
Oh, good, 'cause I heard you were still poor

277
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:02,020
迫于生计只能当个服务员
and that you were working as a waitress.

278
00:14:03,140 --> 00:14:04,260
服务员
A waitress?

279
00:14:04,660 --> 00:14:06,420
一派疯言
That is insane.

280
00:14:06,420 --> 00:14:08,820
简直疯到
That is so insane

281
00:14:08,900 --> 00:14:11,340
应该扔进精神病院的冰浴缸里
it should be in an ice tub in an asylum.

282
00:14:12,220 --> 00:14:14,280
你过得好就好
I'm so glad you're great,

283
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:17,380
因为当我看见你穿着三年前的旧款名牌鞋时
because when I saw you in those three-year-old Louboutins,

284
00:14:17,420 --> 00:14:18,720
我不禁担心起来
I got worried.

285
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:21,580
对了 你嘴唇上方有橙汁印
Also, you have an orange juice mustache.

286
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:30,480
是你啊 麦克斯呢
Oh. Where's Max?

287
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:31,480
牛奶那
Milk.

288
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,760
-麦克斯 听我说 -忙着呢
- Max, listen-- - Busy!

289
00:14:35,213 --> 00:14:37,480
希拉里还没走呢
Hilary's still here.

290
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:40,460
她刚说我是服务员 好大的胆子
And she called me a waitress. How dare her.

291
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:43,780
她羞辱了我 而且这次连个派对都没有
She humiliated me, and I didn't even get a party this time.

292
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:44,960
我要回家了
I'm going home.

293
00:14:45,619 --> 00:14:48,740
希拉里·沃德尔 请到3号收银台报到
Hilary Waldare, report to register three.

294
00:14:48,740 --> 00:14:50,379
老天 广播是喊...
Oh, my God! Did he just say--

295
00:14:50,379 --> 00:14:53,080
希拉里·沃德尔 请到3号收银台
Hilary Waldare. Register three.

296
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:55,060
果然是她 麦克斯 我要翻盘了
He did! Oh, my God! Max!

297
00:14:55,420 --> 00:14:55,980
忙着呢
Busy!

298
00:14:58,040 --> 00:15:00,014
干嘛 你阴魂不散是想加入我们吧
What? Do you wanna just join us?

299
00:15:00,014 --> 00:15:04,140
希拉里·沃德尔在这里上班 她是收银员
Hilary Waldare works here, as a cashier!

300
00:15:04,140 --> 00:15:05,160
我赢了
So I win!

301
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:08,940
人人都知道工作丢人链的顺序是这样
Everyone knows on the job humiliation chain, it goes:

302
00:15:08,940 --> 00:15:11,860
妓女 舞女 服务员
Prostitute, hostess, waitress,

303
00:15:12,180 --> 00:15:15,200
收银员 迪斯尼彩灯巡游的茉莉公主
cashier, Princess Jasmine in the Disney electric light parade.

304
00:15:15,940 --> 00:15:17,940
你不是说就算别人的工作很垃圾
What happened to not looking down

305
00:15:17,940 --> 00:15:19,780
也不应该看不起人家吗
on other people with crappy jobs?

306
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:21,320
那是假道理 这是真人生
Oh please, this is real.

307
00:15:21,700 --> 00:15:24,560
我口袋里的14块心急如"焚"到
Now if you'll excuse me, I have got $14

308
00:15:24,560 --> 00:15:26,620
要把口袋烧出个洞了
burning a second hole in my pocket,

309
00:15:26,620 --> 00:15:29,100
我得去羞辱她了 3号收银台我来啦
and I'm gonna spend it here at register three.

310
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:37,220
靠 你就不能等等我[高潮]吗
What, you couldn't wait for me?

311
00:15:48,460 --> 00:15:50,940
这首歌送给预加工食品处的凯丽
This goes out to Kelly in prepared foods.

312
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:52,700
是长痤疮的凯丽小姐
The Kelly with the cystic acne,

313
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:54,560
不是秃顶的凯利先生哦
Not the Kelly with the bald spot.

314
00:15:56,160 --> 00:15:58,540
愛黛兒的粉丝站出来
Now, where my Adele-heads at?

315
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:03,820
太好了 你这没人排队
I'm glad you have no line,

316
00:16:04,020 --> 00:16:06,479
因为我要赶着上一对一的私教瑜伽课
'cause I have an exclusive private yoga class to get to--

317
00:16:06,479 --> 00:16:09,100
希拉里
Oh, Hilary!

318
00:16:09,100 --> 00:16:10,060
你好 卡洛琳
Yes, Caroline.

319
00:16:10,340 --> 00:16:11,260
我是一名收银员
I am a cashier.

320
00:16:12,260 --> 00:16:13,480
抱歉 我没听清
I'm sorry, a what?

321
00:16:14,180 --> 00:16:15,360
我是一名收银员
I'm a cashier.

322
00:16:16,060 --> 00:16:18,260
没错 我的生活并不如意
Yeah, turns out things aren't great.

323
00:16:18,760 --> 00:16:20,840
我老公为了我爸离开了我
My husband left me for my dad.

324
00:16:22,800 --> 00:16:25,560
把故事版权卖给生活电影台时 钱也没分我
And they didn't even cut me in on the Lifetime Movie rights.

325
00:16:25,580 --> 00:16:26,900
一月份就上映了
It's on in January--

326
00:16:27,060 --> 00:16:28,620
片名是《新娘是岳父》
Father Is the Bride.

327
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:32,060
我帮你把沙拉过称吧
Let me just weigh your salad.

328
00:16:32,460 --> 00:16:35,061
我相信你一定会像我一样 很快振作起来
Well, I'm sure you'll pull yourself together like I did.

329
00:16:35,061 --> 00:16:37,598
因为我现在日子过得得心应手
'cause I'm kind of killing it, life-wise.

330
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:40,360
应该是28美元
That'll be $28.

331
00:16:41,800 --> 00:16:44,200
这里只有14美元
There's only $14 here.

332
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:47,320
一盒沙拉要28美元
$28 for a salad?

333
00:16:48,180 --> 00:16:50,340
这是恐龙甘蓝
Well, that's dinosaur kale.

334
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,860
那我拿错了
Oh! Mistake.

335
00:16:51,940 --> 00:16:53,320
我不要恐龙甘蓝
Didn't want the dinosaur kale.

336
00:16:53,660 --> 00:16:56,420
我不喜欢过时的恐龙 我的甘蓝里也不许有
Never liked dinosaurs and really don't like them in my kale.

337
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:58,940
恐龙甘蓝都拿掉了
Dinosaur kale gone.

338
00:16:58,940 --> 00:17:01,460
你不过是拿出来放在柜台上
You're just putting it on the counter?

339
00:17:04,460 --> 00:17:06,520
我一般不亲自出来买东西
Oh, I don't usually shop for myself.

340
00:17:06,580 --> 00:17:07,720
这样放不对吗
Is that not how it's done?

341
00:17:09,820 --> 00:17:12,400
卡洛琳 你是不是不够钱结账呀
Caroline, do you not have enough money?

342
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:17,560
不 希拉里 我够钱结账哦
No, Hilary, I have enough money.

343
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:22,740
我只是不知道为什么会有这么多鸡蛋
I just don't know why I have so many eggs.

344
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:29,080
钱还你 你妨碍后面排队的人了
Here. You're holding up the line.

345
00:17:29,300 --> 00:17:31,180
显然你不够钱结账
You obviously don't have enough money

346
00:17:31,180 --> 00:17:32,939
买不起这盒沙拉
to pay for your salad.

347
00:17:32,939 --> 00:17:34,841
真可悲
Sad.

348
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:37,080
我不知道你这话是什么意思
I don't know what you're implying.

349
00:17:37,420 --> 00:17:40,600
这位是我非常成功的生意合作伙伴
Oh! Here is my very successful business partner.

350
00:17:41,020 --> 00:17:43,040
抱歉让你久等了 刚才找了好久裤子
Sorry it took so long. I couldn't find my pants.

351
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:46,280
都不知道我裤子是怎么跑到装货区的
I don't know how they made it all the way to the loading dock.

352
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:50,020
承认吧 卡洛琳 你是来羞辱我的
Face it Caroline, you came here to humiliate me

353
00:17:50,020 --> 00:17:51,540
结果丢人到付不起鸡蛋
and you can't even afford that egg.

354
00:17:51,540 --> 00:17:53,040
真是丢死人
On your face.

355
00:17:55,020 --> 00:17:58,120
小姐 这张20块是你掉的吗
Miss, did you drop this $20 bill?

356
00:17:59,220 --> 00:18:01,040
对 没错 是我掉的
Yes! Yes I did!

357
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:02,840
我也掉了点钱
I dropped some money, too.

358
00:18:03,780 --> 00:18:04,880
别得寸进尺
Don't push it.

359
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:08,160
谢谢你 先生 你人真好
Thank you, sir. This is very kind of you

360
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:09,600
真是太感谢你了
And I really appreciate it.

361
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:11,620
我愿为我最喜欢的服务员效劳
Anything for my favorite waitress.

362
00:18:12,940 --> 00:18:15,120
我就知道你是个服务员
Oh, I knew you were a waitress.

363
00:18:17,020 --> 00:18:19,120
你的店烂爆了
Your store sucks!

364
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:22,300
我刚在乳制品货架后做爱了
I just had sex in your dairy department.

365
00:18:23,900 --> 00:18:25,340
不用找了
Keep the change.

366
00:18:25,340 --> 00:18:28,000
就当是送你老爸老公的结婚礼吧
And buy your dad-husband a wedding gift.

367
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:38,130
好 再来一次
Okay, one more time.

368
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:41,440
碟仙 我是否该跟奥列格复合
Ouija, should I be with Oleg?

369
00:18:44,480 --> 00:18:46,519
试了15次 次次皆"是"
15 out of 15 yeses.

370
00:18:46,519 --> 00:18:48,972
还是不够清楚
That's still unclear.

371
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:51,300
苏菲 问碟仙蠢爆了
Sophie, this is silly.

372
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:53,280
你知道你们俩都想复合
You know you two wanna get back together.

373
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:56,860
卡洛琳 我们已经有碟仙板了
Caroline, we already have the Ouija board.

374
00:18:57,180 --> 00:18:59,580
这里不需要多一样又扁又平
We don't need another thing around here that's flat

375
00:18:59,580 --> 00:19:01,120
还每次都错的玩意
and wrong all the time.

376
00:19:03,500 --> 00:19:05,960
好吧 苏菲 我付出那么多
Fine. Sophie, if it's not me,

377
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:08,060
你还不愿意复合 那你走吧
after all I've offered you, go.

378
00:19:08,740 --> 00:19:12,160
问问碟仙 你该跟谁在一起
Ask the spirits who the man you are supposed to be with is.

379
00:19:15,540 --> 00:19:18,160
碟仙 我该跟谁在一起
Ouija, please spell out the name of the man

380
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:20,200
请把他的名字拼出来
that I'm supposed to be with.

381
00:19:21,280 --> 00:19:22,700
瞧 动了
Oh, look, it's moving.

382
00:19:23,488 --> 00:19:29,520
V A N[万]
"V," "A," "N,"--

383
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:32,200
没有互联网之前 世界就是这样的
This is what the world was like before the internet.

384
00:19:33,375 --> 00:19:37,053
K O[科]
"K," "O."

385
00:19:38,100 --> 00:19:38,700
"万科"
"Vanko."

386
00:19:39,820 --> 00:19:41,100
万科这名字不错
Vanko? Yeah, that sounds cute.

387
00:19:41,838 --> 00:19:44,140
我喜欢 抱歉 奥列格
Yeah, I like it-- I'm sorry, Oleg.

388
00:19:44,140 --> 00:19:45,580
碟仙都发话了
The spirits have spoken.

389
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:48,380
我应该跟名叫"万科"的男人在一起
I'm supposed to be with someone named Vanko.

390
00:19:48,540 --> 00:19:50,180
碟仙知道谁最适合我
And they know the best.

391
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:54,060
所以你应该跟名叫"万科"的男人在一起吗
So you're supposed to be with someone named Vanko?

392
00:20:01,822 --> 00:20:06,564
"万科·奥列格·高列彻夫斯基"
"Vanko Oleg Golishevsky"?

393
00:20:09,380 --> 00:20:11,420
我一直用中间名
I go by my middle name

394
00:20:11,600 --> 00:20:13,980
是因为我家已经有七个叫"万科"的了
'cause there were seven other Vankos in my family.

395
00:20:16,260 --> 00:20:19,640
但我本来不知道啊
But I didn't even know that.

396
00:20:20,320 --> 00:20:22,920
这就意味着碟仙...
Yeah, that means the Ouija is--

397
00:20:25,020 --> 00:20:27,540
还真是啊
Ohh...yeah...

398
00:20:27,540 --> 00:20:33,159
不 不 我不要万科
Oh, no, no, Vanko. No!

399
00:20:33,159 --> 00:20:35,089
不要 不要
I-- no, I--no!

400
00:20:35,460 --> 00:20:37,520
我们可以复合 好吗
We can--you and I can get back together, okay?

401
00:20:37,520 --> 00:20:40,640
但我现在不想待在这里
But I just can't be here right now.

402
00:20:40,940 --> 00:20:42,920
我是说 这玩意太他妈吓人了
No, I mean, this is just too damn spooky!

403
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:48,680
我迫不及待想告诉我的兄弟
I can't wait to tell my brothers,

404
00:20:48,680 --> 00:20:50,480
万科哥和万科弟这个消息
Vanko and Vanko, about this.

405
00:20:54,900 --> 00:20:56,660
道上有传言说
Word on the street is

406
00:20:56,660 --> 00:20:58,820
你俩很鄙视当收银员的啊
you've been talking some smack about cashiers.
